# Lodestone Quay (CIPlay lodestone_quay): the quay apron on the south shore at 1.5 m (round 0 -28), the sliced hilltop
# behind it at 12 m (round 0 12); the compass ring's lever, the instrument hut, the builders' store by the crane.
island Lodestone Quay
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Lift Day
zone quay
expect step 1
read Institute notice
expect step 2
use lever
expect story needles 0
read Ida Kristen's letter
expect step 3
read Harbour master Brandt's tide book
expect step 4
zone cutfoot
expect step 5
zone cuttop
expect step 6
open Survey mast deck box
wait 3
expect story leverpin 1
expect step 7
use lever
expect story needles 1
expect step 8
open Instrument hut
wait 3
expect step 10
read Dr. Halvard's log 1
expect step 11
open Builders' store
wait 3
expect done
